SEQUENCE ALIGNMENT
------------------

Input data: 391 taxa with 3 partitions and 8833 total sites (0.172974% missing data)

  ID	Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const	Name
   1	DNA	389	1556	754	345	948	948	LTRregion_DNA
   2	DNA	391	5846	1716	1013	4090	4090	gag_pro_pol_env
   3	DNA	389	1431	510	289	950	950	gag_pX_B_HBZ

Column meanings:
  Unique: Number of unique site patterns
  Infor:  Number of parsimony-informative sites
  Invar:  Number of invariant sites
  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

